    "updated_at": "2018-06-19T12:39:20Z",
    "body": "I wonder if we should adopt this before the draft standard becomes an actual standard. It might well change and then we'd have even more explaining to do. On the other hand, folks not being able to enter dates is rather problematic as well.\r\n\r\n(It also seems rather weird to me they would not embrace the practice of using 00 to represent unknown as you'd think that would have at least some support in software.)",
